1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,424
A system prompt is the standing brief an assistant sees before the user's request.

2
00:00:08,424 --> 00:00:15,240
Start with a plain role so the model knows the job it is here to do.

3
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:22,320
Add boundaries that name allowed actions, forbidden actions, and the shape of a safe answer.

4
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:29,976
A useful prompt also tells the assistant how to pause, ask, or hand off.

5
00:00:29,976 --> 00:00:36,600
Good system prompts turn vague behavior into a repeatable interface contract.
